      "quote": "Use **only the current Terror Level's effect**, even if the card was earned at a lower level."
    },
    {
      "reader": "reader-a",
      "id": "Q103",
      "file": "/home/jonny/projects/boardgame-rules/docs/quality/summary-qa/spirit-island/2026-11-05-batch-002957/expanded-iteration-10/adjudication-01/raw-cases.json",
      "json_pointer": "/readers/reader-a/answers/3/answer",
      "quote": "Invader Phase order is Blighted Island, Fear, Ravage, Build, Explore, then advance cards."
    },
    {
      "reader": "reader-a",
      "id": "Q103",
      "file": "/home/jonny/projects/boardgame-rules/docs/quality/summary-qa/spirit-island/2026-11-05-batch-002957/expanded-iteration-10/adjudication-01/raw-cases.json",
      "json_pointer": "/readers/reader-a/answers/3/evidence/6/text",
      "quote": "6. **Advance cards:** Discard the old Ravage card; slide Build to Ravage and the just-revealed Explore card to Build."
    },
    {
      "reader": "reader-a",
      "id": "Q103",
      "file": "/home/jonny/projects/boardgame-rules/docs/quality/summary-qa/spirit-island/2026-11-05-batch-002957/expanded-iteration-10/adjudication-01/raw-cases.json",
      "json_pointer": "/readers/reader-a/answers/3/answer",
      "quote": "Finish each Blighted action and its triggers, then check victory/defeat before the next separate action."
    },
    {
      "reader": "reader-a",
      "id": "Q103",
      "file": "/home/jonny/projects/boardgame-rules/docs/quality/summary-qa/spirit-island/2026-11-05-batch-002957/expanded-iteration-10/adjudication-01/raw-cases.json",
      "json_pointer": "/readers/reader-a/answers/3/evidence/1/text",
      "quote": "Continue to Fear only if the game is still ongoing."
    },
    {
      "reader": "reader-a",
      "id": "Q103",
      "file": "/home/jonny/projects/boardgame-rules/docs/quality/summary-qa/spirit-island/2026-11-05-batch-002957/expanded-iteration-10/adjudication-01/raw-cases.json",
      "json_pointer": "/readers/reader-a/answers/3/answer",
      "quote": "If loss ends the game at that check, Fear cannot resolve first; continue only if the game remains ongoing."
    },
    {
